  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation with scvi_n200 in an RNA-only multiprofile setup, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6530 and F1 of 0.6283. The results suggest transformer aggregation may offer a slight improvement over avgpool (config_007), though the specific impact of aggregation remains uncertain without direct comparison to other methods. The effectiveness of scvi_n200 in this context is supported, but further experiments are needed to isolate the role of aggregation strategies."
